<title>FRANCE: Elf opens 5.87 pct up on Angola find.</title>
<headline>Elf opens 5.87 pct up on Angola find.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in oil group Elf Aquitaine opened more than five percent higher on Tuesday on the back of a market recovey and the announcement of an important oil find in Angola, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0806 GMT, Elf was up 5.41 percent at 682 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
